                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "If your content includes large attachment files, such as sample project binaries, libraries, or PDFs, we don’t recommend storing them in a regular git repository. Instead, host them in a binary repository such as S3, or use git LFS (Large File Storage)."
